Let
$$
\begin{aligned}
\mathrm{S}_{\mathrm{n}} &=\frac{1}{2 \cdot 5}+\frac{1}{5 \cdot 8}+\frac{1}{8 \cdot 11}+\ldots+\frac{1}{(3 n-1)(3 n+2)} \\
